{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736240/extras/57b2fd363d986db2fd1ce593d404563f.avif?t=1760874990\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lonely and challenging experience with realistic driving physics. Pickup packages, deliver them and escape the death zone to finish the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the package from the pickup location, deliver it and then escape the growing death zone. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat your previous best time, master each level and vehicle, finish optional objectives to earn money, unlock new jobs and buy new cars with your hard-earned cash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Driving</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Delivery Man on Earth features grounded, weighty and challenging driving. Each vehicle behaves in a unique way based on its specifications, such as if it's rear-wheel drive, front-wheel drive or all-wheel drive, its weight, engine, transmission, suspension and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the best car for each job and push it to its limits.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736240/extras/74dce4a79b386efa5dc419638251af6a.poster.avif?t=1760874990\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736240/extras/74dce4a79b386efa5dc419638251af6a.webm?t=1760874990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736240/extras/74dce4a79b386efa5dc419638251af6a.mp4?t=1760874990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earnings and Unlocks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish jobs and optional tasks to unlock new jobs and to earn money. Buy new cars with your earnings. The faster you finish a job, the more you earn.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3736240?t=1760874990","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736240/f713dff0533af064456621c9adbee4bffb0c2d40/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760874990","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736240/23c4518d7913ed4dc1c903470cadcc2f79c74996/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760874990","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736240/23c4518d7913ed4dc1c903470cadcc2f79c74996/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760874990","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3745260,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736240/extras/57b2fd363d986db2fd1ce593d404563f.avif?t=1760874990\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lonely and challenging experience with realistic driving physics. Pickup packages, deliver them and escape the death zone to finish the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the package from the pickup location, deliver it and then escape the growing death zone. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat your previous best time, master each level and vehicle, finish optional objectives to earn money, unlock new jobs and buy new cars with your hard-earned cash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Driving</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Delivery Man on Earth features grounded, weighty and challenging driving. Each vehicle behaves in a unique way based on its specifications, such as if it's rear-wheel drive, front-wheel drive or all-wheel drive, its weight, engine, transmission, suspension and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the best car for each job and push it to its limits.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736240/extras/74dce4a79b386efa5dc419638251af6a.poster.avif?t=1760874990\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736240/extras/74dce4a79b386efa5dc419638251af6a.webm?t=1760874990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736240/extras/74dce4a79b386efa5dc419638251af6a.mp4?t=1760874990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earnings and Unlocks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish jobs and optional tasks to unlock new jobs and to earn money. Buy new cars with your earnings. The faster you finish a job, the more you earn.</p>","developers":["Rebind"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736240/5ff77cc83ce1980863f34bc5efc70aecc0482938/header.jpg?t=1760874990","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3736240/1676593970/af3ea851cc315ab97a9a972c52c14af3785a6eaf/1760766948/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760769399","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3736240/1676593970/af3ea851cc315ab97a9a972c52c14af3785a6eaf/1760766948/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760769399","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/373